{"id":"n15785-1-7","stage":3,"title":"숙녀 · 淑女","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15785-1-7-1","ko":"정말 짜증 나서 죽겠어.","zh":"我真的气得要死了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61174","senseId":"1","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"짜증","meaning":"心烦，厌烦，闹心","explanation":"짜증：心烦，厌烦，闹心","readings":[{"term":"짜증","audio":"/audio/78dd3ebff92b1941ec4a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71579","senseId":"1","lemma":"짜증","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"짜증","audio":"/audio/78dd3ebff92b1941ec4a.mp3"}},{"text":"나서","meaning":"感到烦躁（짜증이 나다）","explanation":"나다：感到烦躁（짜증이 나다）；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"12","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나서","audio":"/audio/3e57ffe9f50d4fca37a8.mp3"}},{"text":"죽겠어.","meaning":"表示前面所指的状态或感觉等程度非常严重。","explanation":"죽다：表示前面所指的状态或感觉等程度非常严重。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"죽다","audio":"/audio/66bd3b1f27c0ee2e97b7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77246","senseId":"1","lemma":"죽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"죽겠어","audio":"/audio/7824510acda78f2894ec.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61174","definition":"没有虚假而真正地。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"78dd3ebff92b1941","term":"짜증","zh":"心烦，厌烦，闹心","audio":"/audio/78dd3ebff92b1941ec4a.mp3","entryId":"71579","definition":"由于不满意而发火或把厌恶之情表露于外；或指那样的性格。","pronunciation":["짜증"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"感到烦躁（짜증이 나다）","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","defini